    "7-day trend. %@." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "7 天趨勢。%@。" } } } },
    "A compact demo readiness summary may be stored in the local App Group for mock complication previews." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "精簡的示範就緒度摘要可能儲存在本機 App Group 中，用於模擬錨面複雜功能預覽。" } } } },
    "A consistent bedtime tonight may support recovery." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "今晚保持固定的就寢時間，可能有助於恢復狀態。" } } } },
    "A few signals may suggest taking the day a little easier." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "幾項訊號顯示，今天可以稍微放慢步調。" } } } },
    "A quick check-in can add context to today's signals." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "快速記錄當下狀態，可以為今天的訊號增添參考。" } } } },
    "A short check-in can add context to the available signals." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "簡短的狀態記錄可以為可用訊號增添參考。" } } } },
    "A validated on-device trend is not available yet." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "目前尚無經驗證的裝置端趨勢。" } } } },
    "Active Energy" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "活動熱量" } } } },
    "Activity data is limited today, so this score stays cautious." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "今天的活動資料有限，因此此分數會保持謹慎。" } } } },
    "Activity Load" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "活動負荷" } } } },
    "Activity load compares steps, active energy, and exercise minutes with your baseline." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "活動負荷會將步數、活動熱量與運動分鐘和您的個人基準比較。" } } } },
    "Activity load is moderate in the mock data." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "模擬資料中的活動負荷屬於中等。" } } } },
    "Activity load uses limited baseline data, so this remains a softer wellness estimate." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "活動負荷使用的基準資料有限，因此這仍是較保守的健康生活估計。" } } } },
    "Apple Health" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apple「健康」" } } } },
    "Apple Health access is read-only for the MVP." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "MVP 階段的 Apple「健康」存取僅供讀取。" } } } },
    "Apple Health Access" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apple「健康」資料存取" } } } },
    "Apple Health Boundaries" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apple「健康」使用範圍" } } } },
    "Apple Health data is not used for advertising, marketing, data mining, or profiling." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apple「健康」資料不會用於廣告、行銷、資料探勘或建立使用者輪廓。" } } } },
    "Apple Health data is unavailable. Showing demo data." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apple「健康」資料無法使用。目前顯示示範資料。" } } } },
    "Average Heart Rate" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "平均心率" } } } },
    "Baseline history is still building, so today's reflection is lower confidence." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "個人基準記錄仍在建立中，因此今天的參考可信度較低。" } } } },
    "Check in with how you feel before adjusting your day." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "調整今天的安排前，先留意自己當下的感受。" } } } },
    "Check-In" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "狀態記錄" } } } },
