    "Continue with Mock Data" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "使用模擬資料繼續" } } } },
    "Consider a lighter activity day if that matches how you feel." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "如果這符合您當下的感受，可以考慮讓今天的活動輕鬆一些。" } } } },
    "Consider a lighter day if that matches how you feel." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "如果這符合您當下的感受，可以考慮今天採取輕鬆一些的方式。" } } } },
    "Consider a lighter plan if that matches how you feel." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "如果這符合您當下的感受，可以考慮較輕鬆的安排。" } } } },
    "Daily wellness reflections using local Apple Health signals and optional check-ins." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "使用本機 Apple「健康」訊號與選用的狀態記錄，提供每日健康生活參考。" } } } },
    "Daily wellness score %d, %@" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "每日健康生活分數 %d，%@" } } } },
    "Dashboard demo values are generated locally and are not stored as a personal history." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "儀表板的示範數值會在本機產生，不會儲存為個人歷史記錄。" } } } },
