    "Fatigue context reflects recent wearable trends and your check-in when available." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "疲勞脈絡會參考近期的穿戴式裝置趨勢，以及可用時的狀態記錄。" } } } },
