    "Health access is denied or limited. StateWatch can continue with mock data until access is changed in Settings." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "健康資料存取已被拒絕或受限。在「設定」中變更存取權前，StateWatch 仍可繼續使用模擬資料。" } } } },
