    "Recent Apple Health data is limited. Showing demo data." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "近期 Apple「健康」資料不足。目前顯示示範資料。" } } } },
    "Recent signals are softer than your recent pattern." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "近期訊號比您近期的狀態稍微柔和。" } } } },
    "Recent signals support a gentler plan if that matches how you feel." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "如果這符合您當下的感受，近期訊號支持較輕鬆的安排。" } } } },
    "Recovery" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "恢復狀態" } } } },
    "Recovery data is limited today, so this score stays cautious." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "今天的恢復資料有限，因此此分數會保持謹慎。" } } } },
    "Recovery reflects HRV, resting heart rate, and recent load compared with your baseline." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "恢復狀態會將 HRV、靜止心率與近期負荷和您的個人基準比較。" } } } },
    "Recovery signals are mixed but not sharply different from recent mock data." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "恢復訊號呈現綜合狀態，但與近期模擬資料沒有明顯差異。" } } } },
    "Recovery signals look generally steady today." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "今天的恢復訊號整體看起來穩定。" } } } },
    "Recovery uses limited baseline data, so this remains a softer wellness estimate." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "恢復狀態使用的基準資料有限，因此這仍是較保守的健康生活估計。" } } } },
