    "Supports a local wellness estimate of recovery and strain when available." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "有資料時，用於支援恢復狀態與負荷的本機健康生活估計。" } } } },
    "The HealthKit request completed. Future local fetchers will use only data available on this device." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "HealthKit 要求已完成。未來的本機擷取服務只會使用這部裝置上可用的資料。" } } } },
